note verify-site.om: main.rs verify_site rules V1-V19, the hub gates H (hubs.rs), box links E
note (boxlink.rs), the /now/ body rule N1 (now.rs page_holds_invariants), the file loop that runs
note C1/C2/G/O5/F on every file, the pre-generation gate (B1-B4) and the CLI entry point.
